{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪二酸化単細胞ぅぅう  うぉう  うぉう   いぇ～い(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お早う御座いますっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新年３日目、皆さん\nいかがお過ごしですか？（ミ＾o＾ミ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしは、とくに考えもなく\nふらーっと１人でお出掛けを\nするのが好きなので、\n昨日も空いてる時間を使って\nお出掛けしてきました(`･ω･´)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、レッスン帰りには、\nななみんといこまちゃんと\nご飯を食べてきました **"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美味しかったし、楽しかったし、\n幸せ です(* ^o^ *)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで、お待たせしていた\n質問返しの前編いきたいと思います ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▼早く起きる秘訣とかありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気持ちだ( `･ω･´)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▼年賀状送ってもいいですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろんです(*^o^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▼SLCOOL OF LOCK いつから\n聴いてるの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中学1年生のときからです ＋\nかな-り好きです(  ^o^  )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▼(バンドで)ELLEGRDENの曲何してた？\nELLEGRDENの曲は何が好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「TheAutumnsong」とか\n「アッシュ」とかコピーしてました ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「Supernova」って曲が好きです(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▼セカオワは何の曲が好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全部好きですが、\n「インタントラジオ」が\n１番好きです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▼吹奏楽では何の楽器やってたんですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テナーサックスをやってました  ♪♪\nユーフォやホルンと同じ\n動きが多い中低音担当です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「テナ夫」って名前付けてました  笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▼さゆにゃんのパパやママは\nどこの星の天使さまなんですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えっ、ぇっ！！   笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▼さゆにゃんの使ってるシャンプーはなんですか？\n参考にしたいです(*∩ω∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"資生堂の「MA CHERIE」\nしっとりの方を使ってます ♀♀"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▼香水つけてる？つけてたら\nなにつけてる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「コットンキャンディ」\nってのをつけてます。\n甘い香りで、お気に入りです◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▼小百合さんのリラックス方法、\nストレス解消方法は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長湯することと音楽鑑賞です ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▼あの花みたことあるのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの花大好きです！\nだって私のSuica、\nめんまちゃんだもの。にやっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台になった場所も\n実際に見に行ったりしました ○"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▼防寒グッズ白色ばっかりですね！\n白が好きなんですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いえーす＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▼視力悪い方ですか？\nカラコンは付けたことありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな-り悪いです。\nメガネがないと何も見えません(T_T)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"目悪いしドライアイなので\nカラコンこわくて\n２ウィーク使ってます；"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▼月食キレイかった(^o^)さゆにゃん見た？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーと\n見ましたっ(*^_^*)\nキレイでしたね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▼さゆにゃんの好きな髪の色は\n黒？それとも…？(｀･ω･´)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"黒髪が好きです○°"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▼女の子からの長文な手紙とか\nプレゼントって大丈夫でしたか(T_T)？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく嬉しいです！\nお手紙も、プレゼントも、本当に\n一つ一つ大事にしてます。\nめっちゃ元気貰えます（ ;  ; ）\nだから気にしなくて大丈夫だよ(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▼スポーツは好きですか？\n何のスポーツが得意ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きです。\n地味になわとびを習ってました(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▼仮面ライダーは好きですか？\nどのライダーが1番好きですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"戦隊には劣りますが、\nクウガとアギトが好きです ＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▼さゆにゃんに推し変してもいいですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わわ申し訳ないです\nああありがとう御座います（ ;  ; ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▼お正月の思い出って何かある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小２のとき、お年玉を大事に大事に\n隠してとっておいたら、\nお兄ちゃんに全部奪われて\n使われてしまったこと(T_T)泣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▼好きな映画は何ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スタジオジブリが好きです。\n一番好きなのは「耳をすませば」です＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他だと、「スウィングガールズ」\nが好きです＾＾"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▼AKBさんの曲でいちばん好きな\n曲はなに？\nAKBの握手会行ったことある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヘビロテは、バンドでやったことが\nあるので思い入れがあります( *^_^* )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヒーローの握手会なら(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▼１番仲良しなのは誰ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな仲良しです＼(^o^)／選べない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▼絶叫系は大丈夫？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きではないんですが、\n大丈夫みたいです(;･ω･)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▼メガレンジャーはどうですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かっこいいです！好きです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▼たけのこの里派、きのこの山派どっち？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うーん、きのこかなぁ(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▼地元は朝初雪でしたが、\n都内は降りましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"降ってないです（ ;  ; ）\n雪だるま作りたい！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▼最近見た夢で、面白かった夢は\n何ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたし、夢を見てもすぐに忘れちゃうんですが\nこの前、いくちゃんが\n「さゆにゃんが髪の毛にこだわって\n気にしすぎるせいで\n夢にまで出てきちゃったよ～！」\nって言ってて、それがすごく\n面白かったです(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな感じです＾＾ ＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、今日も１日お互い\n頑張りましょう ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/03/photo_3.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃん"}],"source":"archive"}